                          "key": "path",
                          "value": "<string>",
                          "description": "(Required) Path to the secret in the KV v2 store. Use forward slashes to organize secrets in a hierarchy. Example: myapp/production/db."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "description": "Retrieve metadata and version history for a secret at the given path. Returns all version timestamps, current version number, max versions setting, CAS required status, and custom metadata."
